OL,3,GNEWSAKnife found by police on street
OL,4,Anear college
OL,5,
OL,6,FA knife was found on a Bradford street
OL,7,Fby police who were called to reports of
OL,8,Fa robbery behind a college campus.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Randall Well
OL,11,FStreet, near Bradford College, at about
OL,12,F10:45 BST, but found the suspect had
OL,13,Fleft the scene in a vehicle.
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Police said there were
OL,16,Fno reports of any injuries and urged
OL,17,Fanyone with information to contact
OL,18,Fthem.
OL,20,FThe college has been contacted for
OL,21,Fcomment.
